.\\n\\nOn God hit:\\n• Increase bonus Damage by +15 for 4s\\n• Stacks once, +1 Stack per 4 Levels (Max 6 Stacks)\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"Attacks deal +15 bonus Physical Damage.\\n\\nOn God hit:\\n• Increase bonus Damage by +15 for 4s\\n• Stacks once, +1 Stack per 4 Levels (Max 6 Stacks)\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2400,\"isLegacy\":false},\"caab60a4-5939-47b7-9a83-60082df91f3b\":{\"slug\":\"toxic-blade\",\"name\":\"Toxic Blade\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icons_T3_ToxicBlade.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"AttackSpeedPercent\":20,\"InhandPower\":25,\"MagicalPenetrationFlat\":10,\"MaxHealth\":100,\"PhysicalPenetrationFlat\":10},\"passive\":\"Hit a God with an Attack: Apply 25% Healing Reduction and 7% Attack Speed reduction for 5s. Gain 7% Attack Speed for 5s.\\n• Attack Speed Buff and Debuff can stack up to 3 times.\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"Hit a God with an Attack: Apply 25% Healing Reduction and 7% Attack Speed reduction for 5s. Gain 7% Attack Speed for 5s.\\n• Attack Speed Buff and Debuff can stack up to 3 times.\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2700,\"isLegacy\":false},\"e6786710-cb2d-427c-b3b0-b259b0472af7\":{\"slug\":\"hastened-fatalis\",\"name\":\"Hastened Fatalis\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icon_T3_HastenedFatalis.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"AttackSpeedPercent\":25,\"InhandPower\":25},\"passive\":\"Attack Hits a God: -12.5% Attack Movement Penalty.\\n\\nMelee hits grant 2 Stacks.\\nStacks up to 4 times.\\n\\nBuff lasts 2s.\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"Attack Hits a God: -12.5% Attack Movement Penalty.\\n\\nMelee hits grant 2 Stacks.\\nStacks up to 4 times.\\n\\nBuff lasts 2s.\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2650,\"isLegacy\":false},\"d6f50569-454a-4b7e-aa59-18132d9001f3\":{\"slug\":\"dominance\",\"name\":\"Do