ply +5 Stacks\\n\\nAttack or Hard Crowd Control an afflicted enemy:\\n• Deal Magical Damage = 1% Max Health per stack in a 4m radius\\n• Remove the Stacks\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2400,\"isLegacy\":false},\"94c8d66d-c651-4ad0-8519-06ba61ae74f1\":{\"slug\":\"heroism\",\"name\":\"Heroism\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/AspectsInfluences/Icon_Starter_Heroism.png\",\"tier\":null,\"itemType\":\"Starter\",\"stats\":{\"GoldPerTime\":1,\"MagicalProtection\":45,\"MaxHealth\":250,\"PhysicalProtection\":45},\"passive\":\"+1 Gold per second.\\n\\nWhen an ally within 8.8m is hit by Hard Crowd Control:\\n• Give them a Shield equal to 50 +10% of your Max Health\\n\\nCooldown: 15s\\n\\nRequires Level 20.\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"+1 Gold per second.\\n\\nWhen an ally within 8.8m is hit by Hard Crowd Control:\\n• Give them a Shield equal to 50 +10% of your Max Health\\n\\nCooldown: 15s\\n\\nRequires Level 20.\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":1800,\"isLegacy\":false},\"90ec2379-31df-4535-b28a-7b6887c584a5\":{\"slug\":\"omen-drum\",\"name\":\"Omen Drum\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Items_T3_OmenDrum.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"EchoItem\":30},\"passive\":\"Adaptive Stat: +50 Strength or +75 Intelligence (based on highest item stat).\\n\\nEach time you Echo: Gain +1 Stack of Dark Resonance\\n• Each Stack of Dark Resonance grants +10% Echo Damage up to 30 stacks.\\n• Stacks last 6 seconds and stacks are halved when duration ends.\\nWhile Damaru is Harmonized:\\n• Gain +100% Echo Damage\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"Adaptive Stat: +50 Strength or +75 Intelligence (based on highest item stat).\\n\\nEach time you Echo: Gain +1 Stack of Dark Resonance\\n• Each Stack of Dark Resonance grants +10% Echo Damage up to 30 stacks.\\n• Stacks last 6 seconds and stacks are halved when duration ends.\\nWhile Damaru is Harmonized:\\n• Gain +100% Echo Damage\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2800,\"isLegacy\":false},\"c78c02d6-7ea8-4e20-8a0f-7beb2f3b767f\":{\"slug\":\"bluestone-brooch\",\"name\":\"Bluestone Brooch\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/AspectsInfluences/Icon_Starter_BluestoneBrooch.png\",\"tier\":null,\"itemType\":\"Starter\",\"stats\":{\"HealthPerTime\":4,\"ManaPerTime\":2.5,\"MaxHealth\":200},\"passive\":\"Adaptive Stat: +30 Strength or +50 Intelligence (based on highest item stat).\\n\\nAbility Hit: +100 Physical Damage over 2s\\n• Gods take additional damage = 7.5% of their current Health\\n• Subsequent hits on the same target: 50% bonus damage for 3s\\n\\nRequires Level 20.\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"Adaptive Stat: +30 Strength or +50 Intelligence (based on highest item stat).\\n\\nAbility Hit: +100 Physical Damage over 2s\\n• Gods take additional damage = 7.5% of their current Health\\n• Subsequent hits on the same target: 50% bonus damage for 3s\\n\\nRequires Level 20.\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2100,\"isLegacy\":false},\"8c42ed25-6979-42ec-ad53-2baabede5472\":{\"slug\":\"necronomicon\",\"name\":\"Necronomicon\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icon_T3_Necronomicon.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"MagicalPower\":50,\"ManaPerTime\":5,\"MaxMana\":300},\"passive\":\"God Kill or Assist: +1 Stack of:\\n• +30 Intelligence\\n\\nStacks up to 6 times.\\n\\nOn Death: Lose 4 Stacks.\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"God Kill or Assist: +1 Stack of:\\n• +30 Intelligence\\n\\nStacks up to 6 times.\\n\\nOn Death: Lose 4 Stacks.\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2550,\"isLegacy\":false},\"eaa918ca-c239-4c12-949a-82ac89b4911a\":{\"slug\":\"spear-of-desolation\",\"name\":\"Spear of Desolation\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icon_T3_SpearofDesolation.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"CooldownReductionPercent\":10,\"MagicalPower\":75,\"MagicalPenetration